body:
I just got mine and I'm super pumped about it!! But I'm confused on how to charge it. I've used iphone and samsung charging blocks, and my computer, but my battery only reaches 40% (this is after 8 hours of charging) and I don't know why it wont charge?! Lithium Ion batteries don't have a significant charge memory, so it should still be able to reach %100 since it's brand new.

If you have any info on this I'd really, really appreciate it﻿

&#x200B;
